        "type": "code",
        "title": [
          "명령형(jQuery)",
          "Imperative (jQuery)"
        ],
        "text": [
          "let count = 0;\nconst button = $('<button>').appendTo(host);\nbutton.text(`Clicked ${count} times`);\nbutton.on('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  button.text(`Clicked ${count} times`);\n});",
          "let count = 0;\nconst button = $('<button>').appendTo(host);\nbutton.text(`Clicked ${count} times`);\nbutton.on('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  button.text(`Clicked ${count} times`);\n});"
        ],
        "language": "javascript",
        "width": 64,
        "explanation": [
          {
            "definition": [
              "DOM 갱신 - 수정 순서의 직접 지정",
              "DOM Updates - Explicit update steps"
            ],
            "details": [
              [
                "버튼 생성 → 이벤트 연결 → 텍스트 수정",
                "Button creation → Event handling → Text updates"
              ],
              [
                "host - 버튼을 추가할 DOM 요소",
                "host - The DOM element receiving the button"
              ]
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "title": [
          "선언형(React)",
          "Declarative (React)"
        ],
        "text": [
          "function Counter() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>\n      Clicked {count} times\n    </button>\n  );\n}",
          "function Counter() {\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n  return (\n    <button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>\n      Clicked {count} times\n    </button>\n  );\n}"
        ],
        "language": "jsx",
        "width": 64,
        "explanation": [
          {
            "definition": [
              "JSX - JavaScript 안의 UI 표현",
              "JSX - UI expressed within JavaScript"
            ],
            "details": [
              [
                "현재 count에 맞는 버튼 UI 선언",
                "Button UI declared for the current count"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "definition": [
              "useState(0) - 상태 초기값 0",
              "useState(0) - Initial state value 0"
            ],
            "details": [
              [
                "setCount → 상태 변경 → React의 버튼 텍스트 갱신",
